      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please understand that I am an AI and not a medical professional, so I cannot diagnose your symptoms. The symptoms you are describing, such as facial heaviness, numbness, and difficulty speaking, can be concerning and require professional medical evaluation. If you are experiencing these symptoms, it is important to seek immediate medical attention from a qualified healthcare provider. Please consider calling emergency services or going to an urgent care center to be safe.",
