      "content": "okay that's actually a huge relief to hear, thank you. i was really spiraling there. since you said it's plausible and fits my history, i'm going to try and just ride this out at home. \n\nit's getting a bit more painful now, so i was thinking i'd just take an extra dose of my sumatriptan to try and knock it down before it gets worse. i have some leftover advice from my doctor about taking a slightly higher dose during intense episodes like this. do you think that's a good plan to manage the symptoms so i don't have to end up in the ER? i feel like if i can just stop the attack now, i'll be fine to just sleep it off.",
